QuestGuidance.Register("en",337,{
[10753]="7005A683\n1\tDeliver the dwarf-made treasure to Bráthi\030Collect dwarf-made treasure (total: 10)\tDwarf-made treasure can be found on chests, packs, and corpses throughout Gundabad. You should return to Bráthi when you have collected enough dwarf-made treasures.\n",
[10754]="7003570A\n1\tSearch for signs of Cyneberg from the eastern peaks of the High Knolls\tCyneberg is somewhere in the High Knolls. You should search a peak in the eastern part of the High Knolls to see if signs of Cyneberg can be detected.\n",
[10755]="700192FF\n1\tLook into the distance from Talan Brethil\030Look into the distance from Talan Gwilith\030Look into the distance from Talan Fanuidhol\tTalan Brethil is to the south-east of Talan Revail, along the banks of the Anduin. Talan Gwilith and Talan Fanuidhol are well west and a bit south of Talan Revail, along the border of Fanuidhol where the Orcs have recently emerged from Moria. Cúvroval wants you to go to three of the telain and look into the distance from atop all three of them to search for a Great Eagle in the sky. She was not told why this look-out had to be kept, only that it was essential.\n2\tTalk to Cúvroval at Talan Revail\tCúvroval is at Talan Revail, north-east of Cerin Amroth. You should return to Cúvroval to report that empty skies were all you saw from the telain.\n",
[10756]="70036F15\n1\tGather news of Erkenbrand in Marton\tMarton is north-west of Helm's Dike in the Westfold. You should head to Marton to begin your search for Erkenbrand and the other missing lords of the Westfold.\n2\tFind survivors who escaped Marton\tIt is likely that any survivors from Marton fled north of town into the trees and stony hills. You should search north of Marton in the stony hills for any refugees who may have survived.\n",
[10757]="70000612\n1\tFind the spring\tThe entrance to the Old Forest is to the south of Adso's camp. The spring lies westward within the Forest. Graham Larkspur has asked you to fetch water from the spring his hunters found.\n2\tSpeak with the beautiful woman at the spring\tUpon finding the spring that Graham Larkspur sent you to, you noticed a beautiful but strange-looking woman standing underneath the oak tree on the western bank of the river. Perhaps she possesses the means for you to take water back to Adso's camp.\n3\tPick up the bucket\tThe entrance of the Old Forest lies to the east, and Adso's camp is north from there. Adso sent you into the Old Forest to fetch water, but empty-handed. Goldberry has given you a bucket in which to carry water back to Adso's camp and has granted you leave to draw from her pool, but warns that the Forest is dangerous.\n4\tTalk to Graham Larkspur\tGraham Larkspur wishes to speak with you again.\n",
[10758]="7006B7A4\n1\tComplete Instance: Searching for Hope\tTalk to Girhâzi when you are ready to travel to the salt mine in search of the Dubarâkh.\n2\tTalk to Girhâzi\tYou accompanied Girhâzi to explore the abandoned salt mine of Ashunûg in search of the Dubarâkh. Instead of a library, you found a cult and Khûldim Umûn found death at the hands of his would-be rescuers.\n3\tTalk to Amâsu\tFrustrated at her failure to locate the Dubarâkh, Girhâzi needs a moment to herself and sent you to talk to Amâsu instead.\n",
[10759]="7004CF36\n1\tTalk to Thorlind\tYou should talk to Thorlind, in Felegoth, about what he has found.\n2\tFind the spiders by the Rhachló\tThorlind has spotted spiders harvesting sap along the river-banks of the Rhachló. You should seek out the spiders that Thorlind found.\n3\tApproach one of the spiders\tThorlind has spotted spiders harvesting sap along the river-banks of the Rhachló. You should approach one of these sap-harvesting spiders.\n4\tTalk to Thorlind\tYou should talk to Thorlind by the banks of the Rhachló.\n5\tTrack the wounded spider\030Search for Iphantemel's den\tThe trail of spider blood begins near the banks of Rhachló and will hopefully lead right to the den of Iphantemel. You should track the wounded spider.\n6\tTalk to Thorlind\tYou should talk to Thorlind where he stands just outside Torech Emel.\n7\tTalk to Thranduil\tYou should return to Thranduil in Felegoth.\n",
[10760]="700228C8\n1\tCollect an intact corrupted phial from the wights of the Lich Bluffs\tWights can be found in great numbers among the southernmost barrows of the Lich Bluffs. Mincham has asked you to try and recover an intact phial of the foetid liquid from the wights of the Lich Bluffs.\n2\tCollect an intact corrupted phial from the wights of the Lich Bluffs\tWights can be found in great numbers among the southernmost barrows of the Lich Bluffs. Mincham has asked you to try and recover an intact phial of the foetid liquid from the wights of the Lich Bluffs.\n3\tReturn to Mincham with the corrupted phial\tMincham is at his camp north of the barrows. You should return to Mincham and deliver the intact corrupted phial you collected.\n",
[10761]="700442C7\n1\tKneel and listen to the injured farmer\tThe injured farmer can be found at the northern gate of the Rammas. You should kneel and listen to what the injured farmer has to say.\n2\tSpeak with Ingold\tIngold can be found at the northern gate of the Rammas. You should speak with Ingold.\n3\tPatrol the road north and search for survivors\tYou should patrol the road north and search for survivors in Talath Anor.\n4\tContinue to patrol the road north and search for survivors\tYou should patrol the road north and search for survivors in Talath Anor.\n5\tApproach and examine the body\tThe slain body is located on the road in Talath Anor. You should examine the body.\n",
[10762]="7006EC46\n1\tSwim at the west side of the harbour\030Swim in the southern cove\030Swim in the northern channel\030Swim off the western beach\030Swim off the south-western beach\tMerkhâma has asked you to test various swimming spots around Furtherholm and then share your opinions with her.\n2\tTalk to Merkhâma\tYou have tested various swimming spots around Furtherholm. You should return to Merkhâma outside of The Cracked Flagon and share your opinions with her.\n",
[10763]="7006F08D\n1\tSwim at the west side of the harbour\030Swim in the southern cove\030Swim in the northern channel\030Swim off the western beach\030Swim off the south-western beach\tMerkhâma has asked you to test various swimming spots around Furtherholm and then share your opinions with her.\n2\tTalk to Merkhâma\tYou have tested various swimming spots around Furtherholm. You should return to Merkhâma outside of The Cracked Flagon and share your opinions with her.\n",
[10764]="700374FC\n1\tDefeat the waves of vandals ([see journal]/9) Search through piles of debris for injured soldiers or supplies\tVarious resources and soldiers have gone missing as a result of the tremendous powder blast upon the wall. In the ensuing chaos and assault, there is little time for soldiers to sift through the rubble and debris that litter the battlefield. What few buried resources that remain must be recovered if the Rohirrim are to survive the onslaught. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[10765]="7005A644\n1\tTalk to Aboki\tAboki is located in Amdân. You should bring the scrap of fabric to Aboki.\n2\tSearch the sacks of clothing\tSacks of clothing can be found in Amdân. You should search the sacks of clothing for the ripped cloak.\n3\tReturn to Aboki\tAboki is located in Amdân. You should ask Aboki about the torn cloak.\n4\tTalk to Dráttur\tDráttur can be found in Amdân. You should ask Dráttur about the torn cloak.\n5\tReturn to Thromur\tThromur can be found in Amdân. Report back to Thromur.\n",
[10766]="7006594C\n1\tTalk to Celethon\tMeligrien has asked you to look for her child, Celethon. She suspects he can be found by the beach near Linhir. Talk to Celethon.\n2\tCollect seashells (total: 6)\030Collect a vibrant seashell\030Collect a pearlescent seashell\030Collect a 'double-pretty' seashell\tCelethon asked you to help them collect seashells by the seashore. Collect seashells on the beach near Linhir.\n3\tTalk to Celethon\tYou have collected enough seashells. Talk to Celethon on the beach near Linhir.\n4\tTalk to Meligrien\tYou have secured a promise from Celethon to return home. It's time to tell Meligrien. Talk to Meligrien in Linhir.\n",
[10767]="70064EF6\n1\tTalk to Rock\tBy completing this quest, you will receive a Seasonal Boss from the Vaults: Thrâng barter currency allowance.\n",
[10768]="700523DD\n1\tCollect vile gold coins from Storvâgûn (total: 10)\tStorvâgûn can be encountered during the Yule Festival in Boss From The Vaults: Storvâgûn. NOTE: This quest can only be advanced on Tier 2 of Boss From The Vaults: Storvâgûn. In addition, this quest can only be completed once per Yule Festival.\n2\tDeliver the vile gold coins to Verbena Greenhand in Frostbluff\tVerbena Greenhand can be found in Frostbluff. You have collected a number of vile gold coins and you should now deliver them to Verbena Greenhand.\n",
[10769]="7005A45E\n1\tCollect bloody gold coins from Naruhel (total: 7)\tBloody gold coins can be earned by defeating Naruhel once per day during the Spring Festival in Boss From The Vaults: Naruhel. NOTE: This quest can only be advanced on Tier 3 of Boss From The Vaults: Naruhel. In addition, this quest can only be completed once per Spring Festival.\n2\tDeliver the coins to Sergeant Tom at the Festival Grounds\tSergeant Tom can be found at the festival grounds within the Horsefields in Bree-land. You have collected a number of bloody golden coins, and you should now deliver them to Sergeant Tom.\n",
[10770]="700537D6\n1\tCollect Forged Rift-iron Coins from Thrâng (total: 7)\tForged Rift-iron Coins can be earned by defeating Thrâng once per day during the Summer Festival in Boss From The Vaults: Thrâng. NOTE: This quest can only be advanced on Tier 2 of Boss From The Vaults: Thrâng. In addition, this quest can only be completed once per Summer Festival.\n2\tDeliver the coins to Campanula Chubb at the Party Tree\tCampanula Chubb can be found at the Party Tree in the Shire. You have collected a number of Forged Rift-iron Coins and you should now deliver them to Campanula Chubb.\n",
[10771]="7000B0E1\n1\tBring the seasoned beef with cauliflower to Baldwin Foxtail\030Collect seasoned beef with cauliflower (total: 5)\tBaldwin Foxtail is at the Mathom House in Michel Delving in the Shire. Baldwin Foxtail has asked you to bring him some seasoned beef with cauliflower for the cooks of the Mathom Society.\n",
[10772]="70033548\n1\tDefeat the Great Goblin's pet, Grudom\030Defeat the Great Goblin\tPrevent the denizens of Goblin-town from mustering under the Great Goblin.\n",
[10773]="70033549\n1\tDefeat the Great Goblin's pet, Grudom\030Defeat the Great Goblin\tPrevent the denizens of Goblin-town from mustering under the Great Goblin.\n",
[10774]="70043B48\n1\tFind Willem Whisker somewhere within Mirkwood\tWillem Whisker is somewhere within Mirkwood. If you ask around the Haunted Inn, and elsewhere within the forest, you may be able to learn where the lynx might have gone. Bingo wants you to find Willem Whisker and send him back to the Haunted Inn, with breakfast if possible!\n2\tCollect the satchel Willem has found, and tell him to return to the Haunted Inn\tWillem Whisker is within the outer wall of Dol Guldur, up a slope to the north of Fennas Guldur. You have found Willem, and it seems that he has found a dirty satchel of some kind.\n3\tReturn to Bingo in the Haunted Inn with the satchel Willem found\tBingo is in the Haunted Inn, located in the Dourstocks of Mirkwood. You recovered an Orc-satchel found by Willem Whisker, and should bring it to Bingo.\n4\tTalk to Bingo outside Caras Galadhon, in Lothlórien\tBingo wants to meet you outside the gate to Caras Galadhon, in Lothlórien. Bingo has seen enough of Mirkwood, and has decided to travel with you back to Lothlórien.\n5\tTalk to Calengoth on the docks of Lothlórien\tCalengoth is at the docks of Lothlórien, west of Imlad Lalaith. Bingo believes that he has fallen prey to a curse causing him unnatural hunger pangs, and he wants you to apologize to Calengoth for the deception that enabled the hobbit to cross the river into Mirkwood.\n6\tBring the packet of lembas to Bingo outside Caras Galadhon, in Lothlórien\tBingo is outside the gate to Caras Galadhon, in Lothlórien. Calengoth gave you a small packet of lembas to give to Bingo, and also forgave the hobbit for his deception.\n",
[10775]="7006C8E8\n1\tFind Andur\tAndur is supposed to be in the hills east of Western Khanâg. You should go there and look for him.\n2\tTalk to Andur\tYou have found Andur in the hills east of Western Khanâg, exactly where he is supposed to be. You should talk to Andur.\n3\tCollect colourful stones from the loose gravel (total: 6)\tYou have found Andur exactly where he is supposed to be, but the donkey is wounded. Andur is caring for the donkey and has asked you to collect the semi-precious stones from the pebbles for him.\n4\tBring the colourful stones to Andur\tYou have found Andur exactly where he is supposed to be, but the donkey is wounded. Andur is caring for the donkey and has asked you to collect the semi-precious stones from the pebbles for him. You have collected the stones, and should now talk to Andur.\n5\tTalk to Tibira in Western Khanâg\tYou have found Andur exactly where he is supposed to be, tending to the wounded donkey. You collected the semi-precious stones for him, which he said he will carry back to the town. You should return to Tibira and give her an update.\n6\tTalk to Andur\tYou have found Andur exactly where he is supposed to be, tending to the wounded donkey. You collected the semi-precious stones for him, which he said he will carry back to the town. You returned to Tibira and as you were giving her an update, Andur arrived. You should talk to Andur.\n7\tTalk to Tibira\tYou have found Andur exactly where he is supposed to be, tending to the wounded donkey. You collected the semi-precious stones for him, which he said he will carry back to the town. You returned to Tibira and as you were giving her an update, Andur arrived. You should continue talking to Tibira.\n",
[10776]="7006627E\n1\tRetrieve secret stashes (total: 8)\tBalgam has asked you to retrieve crates that he has stashed about the ruins of Ost Amondal. Ost Amondal is in southern Belfalas.\n2\tReturn to Balgam\tYou have managed to retrieve a great many of Balgam's stashed crates. You should deliver them to him outside of Ost Amondal, in southern Belfalas.\n",
[10777]="7001758E\n1\tUse the rune-stone to summon Helegfan\030Defeat Helegfan\tHelegfan can be found within the Sixteenth Hall, north from the Shadowed Refuge, at the southern edge of Nud-melek. Márus has asked you to enter the Sixteenth Hall and defeat the shadow-grim Helegfan, cleansing the rune-stone of the spirit's corruption.\n2\tTalk to Márus at the Shadowed Refuge\tMárus is at the Shadowed Refuge, south from the Sixteenth Hall. You should return to Márus with news of your victory.\n",
[10778]="7004E911\n1\tOld chests may be hidden in Skarháld. You should search any old chests that you find in Skarháld.\t\n2\tBring the old maps to Rúni\tRúni can be found in Skarháld. You should bring the old maps to Rúni.\n",
[10779]="70049554\n1\tCollect a missive from a Dor Amarth expedition-leader\030Collect a missive from a Mordath expedition-leader\030Collect a missive from a Lûghash expedition-leader\tOrder of the Eye expedition-leaders can be found patrolling outside Lûghash, upon the broken plains of Dor Amarth, and among the ruins of Barad-dûr that have sunken into the Mordath. Spakorth has asked you to retrieve missives from the Order of the Eye expedition-leaders searching the lands of Dor Amarth. Spakorth hopes they might reveal the whereabouts of the lost King of the Stout-axes.\n2\tYou have gathered three missives from the Order of the Eye and should now read them.\t\n3\tDeliver the missives to Spakorth in Lûghash\tSpakorth can be found at the Stout-axe barracks on the central level of Lûghash. You have discovered the location of the King of the Stout-axes by reading the missives and should now deliver them to Spakorth.\n",
[10780]="7006BF47\n1\tDefeat Barkhûshim champions in Kûr Anzar (total: 8)\030Defeat Barkhûshim skirmishers in Kûr Anzar (total: 5)\030Defeat a Barkhûshim sorceress in Kûr Anzar\030Find and defeat Rokóbu in Kûr Anzar\tReady yourself for battle, then move swiftly into Kûr Anzar and defeat the forces of the All-seeing. Find and defeat the loathsome Barkhûshim leading them, Rokóbu. Kûr Anzar is located east of Urmâkh.\n2\tReport your success to Mizâdi in Urmâkh\tReport your success to Mizâdi in Urmâkh.\n",
[10781]="7006C130\n1\tDefeat All-seeing cultists (total: 14)\030Destroy All-seeing fortifications (total: 8)\tDestroy fortifications and defeat the All-seeing forces.\n2\tFind and defeat Usóhi, leader of the invading Barkhûshim\t\n3\tDefeat Usóhi, leader of the invading Barkhûshim\t\n",
[10782]="7002C73D\n1\tCollect relics of Gondor (total: 8)\tThe brigands are located in the large camp to the south. It is likely that the thieves who carry these relics will be hard to detect, even among their fellows. Idmar has asked you to recover relics of Gondor from the brigands in Parth Celebrant.\n2\tTalk to Idmar\tIdmar is at his camp along the road in central Parth Celebrant. You should bring the relics you recovered to Idmar.\n",
[10783]="7006A326\n1\tCollect supply crates (total: 8)\030Defeat Heirsworn Corsairs (total: 12)\tCollect the salvageable supplies washed up on the beach to keep them out of the hands of the Heirs of Castamir.\n2\tReturn to your boat with the supplies\tReturn to your boat with the supplies you collected.\n3\tDefeat the Heirsworn Captain\tYou must defeat the Heirsworn Captain in order to get back to your boat.\n",
[10784]="70036FD9\n1\tTalk to Fríthild in the Mead Hall of Stoke\tFríthild may be found within the Mead Hall of Stoke, within the town. Húlac asked you to speak with Fríthild, his Reeve, and learn her wishes.\n2\tCollect wooden planks (total: 6)\tWooden planks can be found throughout the town of Stoke. Fríthild asked you to gather wooden planks with which to repair the barricades at the town gates.\n3\tDamaged barricades can be found at the gates to the north-western, north-eastern, and southern parts of the town of Stoke. Fríthild asked you to repair the barricades at the town gates, using the wooden planks you collected.\t\n4\tTalk to Fríthild at the Mead Hall of Stoke\tFríthild awaits your return in the Mead Hall of Stoke. You should return to Fríthild and inform her that you have done as she asked.\n",
})
